# avahi FHS: daemon runtime /var/run/avahi-daemon (pid file, request
# socket). Split-/run invariant: localstatedir=/var already puts the
# daemon paths here; this fragment converges ownership (avahi:70) on
# install/upgrade. Stale-state policy (/var/run is persistent by
# design, never wiped): a stale pid file from an unclean shutdown is
# cleared by the OpenRC start_pre, which runs only when OpenRC is
# about to start the daemon. No legacy /run path: avahi is new to
# Saphira, so no migration stanzas.
dir /var/run/avahi-daemon 0755 avahi avahi
